    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d400-f1" n="60" type="source" xml:id="d400-f1-content">
                <p>SWNCC 227/13, June 14, was approved by SWNCC on June 20 and transmitted the same day
                    with SWN–4439 to the Department. The “conclusions” and Appendixes C and D were
                    transmitted by the Department on June 24 to General McCoy “as representing in
                    substance approved United States policy with regard to restitution policy and
                    procedure”. SWNCC 227/13 was sent to Tokyo in
                    instruction 187, June 25, for the Political Adviser in Japan (Atcheson).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d400-f2" n="61" xml:id="d400-f2-content">
                <p>For text of Appendix C on “Restitution of Looted Property”, adopted by the FEC on July 18, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Activities of the Far Eastern Commission</hi>, p. 80.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
